{"id":"vod_md_5239","vodId":"5239","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"在魔王城说晚安","name_cn":"在魔王城说晚安","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230920-1/d28e6c9a537a6cdfd5fff62de8a34a43.jpg"},"summary":"这是一个人类与魔族共存的世界，但是世界的支配权还是掌握在人类的受众。一天，魔王抓走并囚禁了人类公主栖夜莉丝（水濑祈 配音），并且向人类发出了勒索信，要求人类用世界的支配权来换回公主的自由。为了拯救公主，勇者拂晓（下野纮 配音）踏上了充满了危机的旅途。然而，被囚禁的日子实在是太过于无聊了，古灵精怪又闲不住的栖夜莉丝决定在魔王城里找点乐子。无论是恶魔教会的法师雷欧纳多（石川界人 配音）还是世代侍奉魔王的忠犬哈士奇（小林亲弘 配音），甚至连威风凛凛的魔王（松冈祯丞 配音）本人，都被公主的恶作剧给耍得团团转。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-20 07:56:12","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/HSLCSrFg/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/fFmEgv6f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/FnBzOavt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/tNvLReZm/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/TyUFN6xc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/tnS9oomw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/O4t7LBbs/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/me5moG6r/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/WCGBytMW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/PIEnrJ1N/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/KgwPaqJO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230917/NaUpxvjz/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:30:38.815Z"}